            twoLinkMixedDifference L st.polymers.eval V e.x e.μ g 1 e'.x e'.μ (h1 e') (h2 e') +
            twoLinkMixedDifference L st.R_trunc V e.x e.μ g 1 e'.x e'.μ (h1 e') (h2 e') := by
        dsimp [groupTwoLinkMixedDifference, twoLinkMixedDifference,
