        · rw [groupTwoLinkMixedDifference_groupWilsonAction_eq_zero_of_not_mem_dobrushinNeighbors
            su2CompactGaugeClassTrace st.β V e e' h_ne h_mem g 1 (h1 e') (h2 e'), abs_zero]
