            twoLinkMixedDifference L st.polymers.eval V e.x e.μ g 1 e'.x e'.μ h1 h2 +
            twoLinkMixedDifference L st.R_trunc V e.x e.μ g 1 e'.x e'.μ h1 h2 := by
        dsimp [groupTwoLinkMixedDifference, twoLinkMixedDifference,
