/-- CONDITIONAL: (on `CanonicalProbeClusterRemainder β₀`, R1). Two-sided degree-4 sandwich
`((3 / 4) * (1 / 4) ^ 5) * β ^ 4 ≤ wilsonProbeCov L β ≤ ((5 / 4) * (1 / 4) ^ 5) * β ^ 4` for `L ≥ 4` and `0 < β ≤ β₀`. -/
theorem wilsonProbeCov_sandwich_of_clusterRemainder {β₀ : ℝ} (hR : CanonicalProbeClusterRemainder β₀)
    {L : ℕ} [NeZero L] (hL : 4 ≤ L) {β : ℝ} (hβ : 0 < β) (hβ₀ : β ≤ β₀) :
