  linarith

/-! ## 2. Obligation `R3` & `R5` — `crossoverLandingSchedule`, `BalabanMultiScaleUVToIRFlow` (17/20), & `LandingTube` (16/18) -/

/-- Constant-crossover schedule `β_sched (j + 1) = canonicalCrossoverBetaLo` for `j ≥ 0`. -/
noncomputable def crossoverLandingSchedule : ℕ → ℝ :=
